  "description": "Design and manufacture of helicopter main rotor systems: hub architectures (articulated, semi-rigid teetering, rigid), blade dynamics (flapping, lead-lag, feathering), pitch control linkages, and composite/metal blade construction. The rotor hub must absorb aerodynamic and inertial loads while transmitting collective and cyclic pitch commands from the swashplate to each blade.",
